  "definition": "macro[loss + lambda*spent/B - min_j(loss_j + lambda*credits_j/B)], credits_j <= B",
  "interpretation": "Signed finite-menu regret to a common loss-cost oracle. Positive lambda strictly penalizes extra spend at fixed loss. Ranking equals penalized loss on the same cohort.",
